"management","s":"Peter Crawford","x":"We contained our expense growth despite that revenue outperformance and continued high inflation and increases in some third-party pass-through fees, we contained our expense growth within the range that we communicated.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SCHW 2023 Q2","e":"schw","d":"2023-07-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Walt Bettinger","x":"These savings will come from a variety of areas, real estate savings, lower headcount from efficiencies gained via automation built and implemented as part of the integration work, streamlining our organization to ensure we are set up to operate most efficiently post integration.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SCHW 2023 Q2","e":"schw","d":"2023-07-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rick Wurster","x":"At the same time, we are adhering to the financial discipline that is the hallmark of our all-weather business model by identifying opportunities for cost savings and efficiencies that will allow us to reinvest in our clients and reward our stockholders.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SCHW 2023 Q3","e":"schw","d":"2023-10-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rick Wurster","x":"Another $500 million plus in annual savings will come from streamlining our operating model, which includes eliminating positions from predominantly non-client-facing areas and reducing our real estate footprint.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SCHW 2023 Q3","e":"schw","d":"2023-10-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Peter Crawford","x":"And with an adjusted pretax margin of over 41%, 30% on a GAAP basis due to the large restructuring charge this quarter, we are navigating from a position of strength.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SCHW 2023 Q4","e":"schw","d":"2024-01-17","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rick Wurster","x":"We'll continue making investments in artificial intelligence to empower our teams to serve clients even more effectively.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SCHW 2023 Q4","e":"schw","d":"2024-01-17","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Devin Ryan","x":"…some of the other questions, but probably for Rick, since you mentioned in your remarks, so obviously the firm has a strong technology background, so I'd love to just talk a little bit more detail about the opportunity you guys see from artificial intelligence investment as we look beyond 2024.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SCHW 2023 Q4","e":"schw","d":"2024-01-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Walt Bettinger","x":"They had experienced this incredible run-up in the value of the firm, followed by the pain of multiple rounds of employee layoffs and a stock price that had collapsed from the ‘50s to mere single digits.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SCHW 2023 Q4","e":"schw","d":"2024-01-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rick Wurster","x":"We captured approximately $500 million in annual run rate expense savings through streamlining our operating model, which included position eliminations from predominantly non-client facing areas, as well as reducing our real estate footprint.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SCHW 2024 Q1","e":"schw","d":"2024-04-15","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rick Wurster","x":"As we look forward, we'll fully realize our planned synergies from the Ameritrade integration and we'll invest in AI.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SCHW 2024 Q1","e":"schw","d":"2024-04-15","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jeff Edwards","x":"Recognizing this is a bit of a topic to jour across most industries, could you spend a minute talking about the role of AI or artificial intelligence in Schwab's go-forward strategy?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SCHW 2024 Q1","e":"schw","d":"2024-04-15","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Peter Crawford","x":"There's trading pass-through expenses that are aligned with revenue.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SCHW 2024 Q2","e":"schw","d":"2024-07-16","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rick Wurster","x":"We will invest in technology, including artificial intelligence, that will ultimately help us lower our costs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SCHW 2024 Q2","e":"schw","d":"2024-07-16","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Peter Crawford","x":"And as a reminder, about half that change from the previous guidance is due to unanticipated onetime items such as the FDIC surcharge and the regulatory accrual, with the remainder coming from the increase in the SEC 31 fee, which is, again, is a pass-through expense and, therefore, P&L neutral.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SCHW 2024 Q3","e":"schw","d":"2024-10-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Verdeschi","x":"We keep that analysis fresh of looking at what a restructuring could entail.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SCHW 2024 Q3","e":"schw","d":"2024-10-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Verdeschi","x":"So that does that is inclusive of that restructuring from this year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SCHW 2024 Q4","e":"schw","d":"2025-01-21","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rick Wurster","x":"We'll continue to invest in AI and other technology to help employees across the firm do their jobs more efficiently.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SCHW 2024 Q4","e":"schw","d":"2025-01-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Verdeschi","x":"Restructuring is not something we're taking off the table.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SCHW 2025 Q1","e":"schw","d":"2025-04-17","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rick Wurster","x":"We're also investing in our support of self-directed clients, including our AI powered capabilities.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SCHW 2025 Q1","e":"schw","d":"2025-04-17","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rick Wurster","x":"Our AI investments are part of supporting both.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SCHW 2025 Q1","e":"schw","d":"2025-04-17","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Rick Wurster","x":"We saw our two highest trading days ever, the Friday before the pausing of the tariffs and then the day that we paused tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SCHW 2026 Q1","e":"schw","d":"2026-04-16","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Richard Wurster","x":"Finally, I want to spend a few minutes diving into how artificial intelligence is accelerating our strategy and the fast pace at which we are launching impactful AI capabilities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/16/schwab-schw-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SCHW 2026 Q1","e":"schw","d":"2026-04-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard Wurster","x":"And we are streamlining back-office processes and operations, risk and across the firm to save time and resources.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/16/schwab-schw-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SCHW 2026 Q2","e":"schw","d":"2026-07-21","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rick Wurster","x":"We're investing in enhancing our AI experience, 